}

sections.code:
* {border-radius: 0px !important;}

img {filter: brightness(80%) !important;}

/* a { text-decoration: underline !important; }
a:link { color: #7aa2f7 !important; }
a:visited { color: cyan !important; } */

@media (forced-colors: active) {
a {text-decoration: underline !important;}
a:visited {color: ButtonBorder !important;}
a:link {color: ActiveText !important;}
}

/* 
Canvas - The background color of the content area (typically the page background).
CanvasText - The text color used on the canvas (usually the default text color).
LinkText - The color of unvisited hyperlinks.
VisitedText - The color of visited hyperlinks.
ActiveText - The color of active hyperlinks (e.g., when clicked).
ButtonFace - The background color of buttons.
ButtonText - The text color used on buttons.
ButtonBorder - The border color of buttons (though borders are less commonly styled in forced-colors mode).
Field - The background color of form fields (e.g., input boxes).
FieldText - The text color inside form fields.
Highlight - The background color of selected text or UI elements (e.g., text selection or focus highlights).
HighlightText - The text color of selected text.
Mark - The background color of text marked with the <mark> element.
MarkText - The text color of text within a <mark> element.
GrayText - The color for disabled or inactive text.
*/

